                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e2794e1-36bb-30f7-9461-06f1272f9262",
                        "entry_id": "c0a3ed94-474d-31b3-a69f-e061382f5209",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of a series of organic bases obtained by the reduction of compounds related to the nitrogenous radical NOH of the ketones. Typically, they are unstable oily substances with a pungent odor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a673b0aa-f7b1-466b-9042-576cbc54f94d",
                                "sense_id": "5e2794e1-36bb-30f7-9461-06f1272f9262",
                                "text": "Pyrazine, aldine, C₄H₄N₂ (colourless prisms, M. Pt. 55°, B. Pt. 115°), possesses a basic character (B. 26, 721) and is the mother substance of the ketines, e.g. Ketine or dimethyl-pyrazine, C₄H₂ (CH₃ )₂ N₂, which is obtained by the reduction of isonitroso-acetone or the condensation of amido-acetone (p. 157; B. 19, 2524; 21, 19)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1de493b1-1ad6-4731-8a27-00bf1e52ef5d",
                                "sense_id": "5e2794e1-36bb-30f7-9461-06f1272f9262",
                                "text": "Fast pyrolysis of biomass occurs usually at 500-700 °C and high heating rates (e.g. 300 °C min⁻¹) over a short time, e.g. pyrolysis of pine wood samples at 550 °C results in the release of high amounts of aldehydes, ketines and methoxylated phenol."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdcca9b1-25d3-4d63-82cb-468503922c37",
                                "sense_id": "5e2794e1-36bb-30f7-9461-06f1272f9262",
                                "text": "ABS materials are however susceptible to chemical attacks by chlorinated solvents, esters, ketines, acids and alkalis."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
